Slide 7 – Chunking Strategies

Three chunking strategies are evaluated.

Fixed Chunking
Equal chunk size
Fixed overlap
Fast processing
May split meaningful sentences
Recursive Chunking
Uses paragraph hierarchy
Preserves document structure
Better context retention
Semantic Chunking
Uses embedding similarity
Splits based on meaning
Highest semantic quality
Slide 8 – Chunk Comparison
Strategy	Advantages	Limitations
