Slide 11 – Retrieval Evaluation

Evaluation Metrics

Hit@K

Measures whether the correct document appears in the top retrieved results.

Higher value indicates better retrieval.

Mean Reciprocal Rank (MRR)

Evaluates the ranking position of the correct answer.

Higher MRR indicates better ranking quality.

These metrics compare retrieval effectiveness across different chunking strategies.

